; file TETS.HP41
; use emacs and cc41 for editing/testing/debugging
;
; Title: Tetration calculation via infinite series calculation
;        see https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tetration
;        This is the inverse function of X^(1/X)
;
; Scope: For evaluation X^X^X^X.. 
;        infinite (stop when the programm dont see a
;        difference of 1E-8 between 2 steps
;        no result/convergence for x<= 1/e 
;        take long calc time (or many steps) around x=e, around x=1/e
;        else the result is out quite quick
;
;        .. for what..?
;        look at relation with infinite calc for elliptique
;           curve calculation
;        look at gamma between 1 and 2
;
; Output: the result in X
;         the number of calculation steps in Y
;
; Inputs: Value in X then XEQ TETS
;
; Recommendation: put these outputs into desmos.com for visualization
;
; Typical screen/printer output: none so far included here
;
; HP41 preferred specification: none
;
; Used modules functions: none
;
; Alternative modules functions: NA
;
; Required devices: none
;
; Registers impacted:
;  R00  step counter for achieving the precision
; under CC BY SA CreativeCommons 4.0 floppy from https://www.hpmuseum.org/forum/
;
; Change log:
;  2022 12 26 creation
;  2022 12 26 update description For evaluation A=x^(1/x); A^A^A^A.. 
;  2026 03 18 simplify for tetration X^X^X^X
;             (the user to put what he want in X.. X^(1/X).. or others)
;  YYYY MM DD ...... what was changed
;
; Remarks to how/what to improve the code: stack only?
;
; Remarks to how/what improve in the HP41 functionality: 
;  use straight the lambert function (not tested)
;
LBL "TETS"
0       ; 0       X0
STO 00  ; step counter initialized
RDN     ; X0
;
; test   X0 => e^(-e)   x: 0.065988036    and 
;        X0 <= e^(1/e)  x: 1.444667861
;        else OUT OF RANGE
;
STO Y
STO Z
1
E^X
ENTER
CHS
Y^X     ; e^(-e)   X0    X0   X0
X>Y?
GTO 01
CLX
1
E^X
ENTER
1/X
Y^X
X<Y?
GTO 01
X<>Y
;
STO Z   ; X0      xx    X0    xx
STO T   ; X0      xx    X0    X0
;
LBL 00  ; start main loop
RDN
RDN
X<>Y    ; Xn      X0
RCL Y   ; X0      Xn     X0
RCL Y   ; Xn      X0     Xn      X0
Y^X     ; Xn+1    Xn     X0      X0
ISG 00
""
; VIEW X  ; just show the evolution of the calculation at the screen
X<>Y    
STO T   ; Xn       Xn+1    X0     Xn
X<>Y    ; Xn+1      Xn     X0     Xn
-       ; Xn-Xn+1   X0     Xn     Xn
LASTX   ; Xn+1   Xn-Xn+1   X0     Xn
STO T   ; Xn+1   Xn-Xn+1   X0     Xn+1
RDN     ; Xn-Xn+1   X0     Xn+1   Xn+1
ABS     ; ABS(Xn+1-Xn)  X0  Xn+1   Xn+1
.00000001 ; 0.00001  ABS(Xn+1-Xn)   X0    Xn+1
X<=Y?
GTO 00
R^
RCL 00
X<>Y
RTN
LBL 01
"OUT OF RANGE"
AVIEW
RTN
